,{\"style\":{\"display\":\"inline-block\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontSize\":14,\"fontWeight\":400,\"lineHeight\":\"49px\",\"margin\":0},\"children\":\"This page could not be found.\"}]}]]}]}]],[]],\"forbidden\":\"$undefined\",\"unauthorized\":\"$undefined\"}]}]}]]}],{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"error\":\"$undefined\",\"errorStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"errorScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{}],\"templateStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"templateScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"notFound\":\"$undefined\",\"forbidden\":\"$undefined\",\"unauthorized\":\"$undefined\"}]]}],{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"error\":\"$undefined\",\"errorStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"errorScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{}],\"templateStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"templateScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"notFound\":\"$undefined\",\"forbidden\":\"$undefined\",\"unauthorized\":\"$undefined\"}]]}],{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"error\":\"$undefined\",\"errorStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"errorScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{}],\"templateStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"templateScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"notFound\":\"$undefined\",\"forbidden\":\"$undefined\",\"unauthorized\":\"$undefined\"}]]}],{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[\"$L4\",[[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-0\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/chunks/0xv9uz7g8af6d.js\",\"async\":true,\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}]],[\"$\",\"$L5\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$6\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@7\"}]}]]}],{},null,false,null]},null,false,\"$@8\"]},null,false,\"$@8\"]},null,false,\"$@8\"]},null,false,null],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L9\",null,{\"children\":\"$La\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$Lb\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$6\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":\"$Lc\"}]}]}],[\"$\",\"meta\",null,{\"name\":\"next-size-adjust\",\"content\":\"\"}]]}],false]],\"m\":\"$undefined\",\"G\":[\"$d\",[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/chunks/0-7zhabl4g7ue.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\",\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}]]],\"S\":true,\"h\":null,\"s\":\"$undefined\",\"l\":\"$undefined\",\"p\":\"$undefined\",\"d\":\"$undefined\",\"b\":\"CCxR80sZRnjlIdOoXSFK7\"}\ne:[]\n8:\"$We\"\nf:I[22016,[\"/_next/static/chunks/01xlw8hd842-c.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_nmn.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0xv9uz7g8af6d.js\"],\"\"]\n10:I[16505,[\"/_next/static/chunks/01xlw8hd842-c.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_nmn.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0xv9uz7g8af6d.js\"],\"LessonClient\"]\n11:T959,# User and License Management\n\nThe Microsoft Graph PowerShell module provides complete user lifecycle management, from creating accounts to assigning licenses.\n\n## Getting User Information\n\nRetrieve users from your tenant:\n\n```powershell\n# Get all users\nGet-MgUser -All\n\n# Get a specific user by UPN\nGet-MgUser -UserId \"alex@contoso.com\"\n\n# Select specific properties\nGet-MgUser -All -Property DisplayName, UserPrincipalName, Department `\n    | Select-Object DisplayName, UserPrincipalName, Department\n```\n\n> **Key Concept:** Microsoft Graph cmdlets return a limited set of properties by default. Use the `-Property` parameter to request additional fields, and pipe to `Select-Object` to shape your output.\n\n## Creating New Users\n\nCreate a user account with `New-MgUser`:\n\n```powershell\n$passwordProfile = @{\n    Password                      = \"TempP@ss123!\"\n    ForceChangePasswordNextSignIn = $true\n}\n\nNew-MgUser -DisplayName \"Pat Johnson\" `\n    -UserPrincipalName \"pat@contoso.com\" `\n    -MailNickname \"pat\" `\n    -AccountEnabled:$true `\n    -PasswordProfile $passwordProfile\n```\n\n## Updating Users\n\nModify existing user properties with `Update-MgUser`:\n\n```powershell\nUpdate-MgUser -UserId \"pat@contoso.com\" `\n    -Department \"Engineering\" -JobTitle \"Developer\"\n```\n\n## Filtering with -Filter\n\nThe `-Filter` parameter uses OData syntax for efficient server-side filtering:\n\n```powershell\n# Find all users in the Engineering department\nGet-MgUser -Filter \"department eq 'Engineering'\" -All\n\n# Find disabled accounts\nGet-MgUser -Filter \"accountEnabled eq false\" -All\n```\n\n## Checking Available Licenses\n\nUse `Get-MgSubscribedSku` to view your tenant's license inventory:\n\n```powershell\nGet-MgSubscribedSku | Select-Object SkuPartNumber, ConsumedUnits,\n    @{Name=\"TotalUnits\"; Expression={$_.PrepaidUnits.Enabled}}\n```\n\n## Assigning Licenses\n\nAssign a license to a user with `Set-MgUserLicense`:\n\n```powershell\n$sku = Get-MgSubscribedSku | Where-Object { $_.SkuPartNumber -eq \"ENTERPRISEPACK\" }\n\nSet-MgUserLicense -UserId \"pat@contoso.com\" `\n    -AddLicenses @(@{SkuId = $sku.SkuId}) `\n    -RemoveLicenses @()\n```\n\n> **Key Concept:** `Set-MgUserLicense` requires both `-AddLicenses` and `-RemoveLicenses` parameters, even if one is empty. Pass an empty array `@()` for whichever operation you are not performing. The `-AddLicenses` parameter takes an array of hashtables with `SkuId` keys.\n4:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-h-screen bg-zinc-950 text-zinc-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"header\",null,{\"className\":\"sticky top-0 z-10 border-b border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/80 backdrop-blur-xl\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto flex max-w-4xl items-center justify-between px-6 py-3.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$Lf\",null,{\"href\":\"/module/sharepoint-m365\",\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-zinc-500 transition-colors hover:text-zinc-300\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-4 w-4\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"d\":\"M10.5 19.5L3 12m0 0l7.5-7.5M3 12h18\"}]}],\"SharePoint & M365 PowerShell\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$Lf\",null,{\"href\":\"/module/sharepoint-m365/teams-and-groups\",\"className\":\"flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-zinc-800 text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:border-zinc-700 hover:text-zinc-200\",\"title\":\"Managing Teams and Groups\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-4 w-4\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"d\":\"M15.75 19.5L8.25 12l7.5-7.5\"}]}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs tabular-nums text-zinc-500\",\"children\":[6,\" / \",8]}],[\"$\",\"$Lf\",null,{\"href\":\"/module/sharepoint-m365/bulk-operations\",\"className\":\"flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-zinc-800 text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:border-zinc-700 hover:text-zinc-200\",\"title\":\"Bulk Operations\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-4 w-4\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"d\":\"M8.25 4.5l7.5 7.5-7.5 7.5\"}]}]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 pb-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"User and License Management\"}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L10\",null,{\"lesson\":{\"meta\":{\"title\":\"User and License Management\",\"description\":\"Microsoft Graph PowerShell for users and licenses.\",\"slug\":\"user-and-license-management\",\"order\":6,\"prerequisites\":[\"m3-l5\"]},\"content\":\"$11\",\"exercises\":[{\"id\":\"m3-l6-ex1\",\"type\":\"syntax-check\",\"prompt\":\"Write the command to get all users and display only their DisplayName and UserPrincipalName. Use the -Property parameter and pipe to Select-Object.\",\"hints\":[\"Start with Get-MgUser -All to get all users.\",\"Use -Property to request specific fields from the API.\",\"Pipe to Select-Object to shape the output.\"],\"validation\":[{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"Get-MgUser\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Use the Get-MgUser cmdlet.\"},{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"-All\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Add -All to return all users.\"},{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"-Property\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Use -Property to request specific fields.\"},{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"DisplayName\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Include DisplayName in your property list.\"},{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"UserPrincipalName\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Include UserPrincipalName in your property list.\"},{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"Select-Object\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Pipe to Select-Object to display only the requested properties.\"}],\"solution\":\"Get-MgUser -All -Property DisplayName, UserPrincipalName | Select-Object DisplayName, UserPrincipalName\",\"explanation\":\"The -Property parameter tells the Graph API which fields to return, while Select-Object shapes the PowerShell output. Both are needed for clean, efficient results.\"},{\"id\":\"m3-l6-ex2\",\"type\":\"syntax-check\",\"prompt\":\"Write the command to find all users in the 'Sales' department using the -Filter parameter.\",\"hints\":[\"Use Get-MgUser with -Filter for server-side filtering.\",\"OData filter syntax: \\\"department eq 'Sales'\\\".\",\"Add -All to ensure all matching results are returned.\"],\"validation\":[{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"Get-MgUser\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Use the Get-MgUser cmdlet.\"},{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"-Filter\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Use the -Filter parameter for server-side filtering.\"},{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"department\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Filter on the department property.\"},{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"Sales\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Filter for the value 'Sales'.\"}],\"solution\":\"Get-MgUser -Filter \\\"department eq 'Sales'\\\" -All\",\"explanation\":\"The -Filter parameter sends an OData query to the Graph API, which filters results on the server. This is much faster than retrieving all users and filtering locally.\"},{\"id\":\"m3-l6-ex3\",\"type\":\"syntax-check\",\"prompt\":\"Write the command to update the user 'bob@contoso.com', setting their Department to 'Finance' and JobTitle to 'Analyst'.\",\"hints\":[\"Use Update-MgUser to modify user properties.\",\"The -UserId parameter takes the user's UPN or object ID.\",\"Use -Department and -JobTitle parameters.\"],\"validation\":[{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"Update-MgUser\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Use the Update-MgUser cmdlet.\"},{\"rule\":\"regex\",\"pattern\":\"-UserId\\\\s+[\\\"']?bob@contoso\\\\.com[\\\"']?\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Specify -UserId \\\"bob@contoso.com\\\".\"},{\"rule\":\"regex\",\"pattern\":\"-Department\\\\s+[\\\"']?Finance[\\\"']?\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Set -Department to 'Finance'.\"},{\"rule\":\"regex\",\"pattern\":\"-JobTitle\\\\s+[\\\"']?Analyst[\\\"']?\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Set -JobTitle to 'Analyst'.\"}],\"solution\":\"Update-MgUser -UserId \\\"bob@contoso.com\\\" -Department \\\"Finance\\\" -JobTitle \\\"Analyst\\\"\",\"explanation\":\"Update-MgUser modifies properties of an existing user. You only need to specify the properties you want to change.\"},{\"id\":\"m3-l6-ex4\",\"type\":\"syntax-check\",\"prompt\":\"Write the command to view all subscribed SKUs in your tenant, showing the SkuPartNumber and ConsumedUnits.\",\"hints\":[\"Use Get-MgSubscribedSku to list available licenses.\",\"Pipe to Select-Object to pick specific properties.\",\"The properties are SkuPartNumber and ConsumedUnits.\"],\"validation\":[{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"Get-MgSubscribedSku\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Use the Get-MgSubscribedSku cmdlet.\"},{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"Select-Object\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Pipe to Select-Object to choose which properties to display.\"},{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"SkuPartNumber\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Include SkuPartNumber in the output.\"},{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"ConsumedUnits\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Include ConsumedUnits in the output.\"}],\"solution\":\"Get-MgSubscribedSku | Select-Object SkuPartNumber, ConsumedUnits\",\"explanation\":\"Get-MgSubscribedSku returns license information for your tenant. SkuPartNumber is the license name (e.g., ENTERPRISEPACK) and ConsumedUnits shows how many are in use.\"},{\"id\":\"m3-l6-ex5\",\"type\":\"syntax-check\",\"prompt\":\"Write the command to assign a license to user 'pat@contoso.com'. Use Set-MgUserLicense with -AddLicenses containing a SkuId from $skuId, and an empty -RemoveLicenses array.\",\"hints\":[\"Use Set-MgUserLicense to assign licenses.\",\"-AddLicenses takes an array of hashtables: @(@{SkuId = $skuId}).\",\"-RemoveLicenses must be provided even if empty: @().\"],\"validation\":[{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"Set-MgUserLicense\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Use the Set-MgUserLicense cmdlet.\"},{\"rule\":\"regex\",\"pattern\":\"-UserId\\\\s+[\\\"']?pat@contoso\\\\.com[\\\"']?\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Specify -UserId \\\"pat@contoso.com\\\".\"},{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"-AddLicenses\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Use -AddLicenses to specify licenses to add.\"},{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"$$skuId\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Reference the $skuId variable for the SkuId value.\"},{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"-RemoveLicenses\",\"hintOnFail\":\"You must include -RemoveLicenses (use @() for an empty array).\"}],\"solution\":\"Set-MgUserLicense -UserId \\\"pat@contoso.com\\\" -AddLicenses @(@{SkuId = $skuId}) -RemoveLicenses @()\",\"explanation\":\"Set-MgUserLicense requires both -AddLicenses and -RemoveLicenses. Each license in -AddLicenses is a hashtable with a SkuId key. Pass @() when you have nothing to remove.\"}],\"moduleSlug\":\"sharepoint-m365\"}}],\"$L12\"]}]\n12:[\"$\",\"footer\",null,{\"className\":\"border-t border-zinc-800/60\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto flex max-w-4xl items-center justify-between px-6 py-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$Lf\",null,{\"href\":\"/module/sharepoint-m365/teams-and-groups\",\"className\":\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:text-zinc-200\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"d\":\"M10.5 19.5L3 12m0 0l7.5-7.5M3 12h18\"}]}],\"Managing Teams and Groups\"]}],[\"$\",\"$Lf\",null,{\"href\":\"/module/sharepoint-m365/bulk-operations\",\"className\":\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:text-zinc-200\",\"children\":[\"Bulk Operations\",[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"d\":\"M13.5 4.5L21 12m0 0l-7.5 7.5M21 12H3\"}]}]]}]]}]}]\na:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n13:I[27201,[\"/_next/static/chunks/01xlw8hd842-c.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_nmn.js\"],\"IconMark\"]\n7:null\nc:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"PowerShell Training\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Interactive PowerShell training — from basics to SharePoint administration.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/favicon.ico?favicon.0x3dzn~oxb6tn.ico\",\"sizes\":\"256x256\",\"type\":\"image/x-icon\"}],[\